  "title": "Lecture 19. Psychological Service in the Education System as an Agent of Prevention",
  "video_url": "https://vkvideo.ru/video_ext.php?oid=-231392328&id=456239036&hash=e2a0f423cb93aab1&hd=3",
  "summary": "<h3><strong>1. Universal Algorithm for Goal-Oriented Activity</strong></h3>\n<p>Any preventive work is based on a fundamental behavioral cycle: <strong>Problem ⇒ Solution ⇒ Evaluation</strong>. In program design methodology, this cycle is detailed into 5 sequential steps.</p>\n    <figure class=\"lecture-slide-card\">\n      <div class=\"slide-card-header\">\n        <span class=\"slide-badge\">🖼️ Slide 5 step algorithm 19.1</span>\n        <span class=\"slide-caption-title\">Slide 5 step algorithm 19.1</span>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"/ru/academy/course/img/5_step_algorithm_19.1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"slide-zoom-btn\" title=\"Click to open slide in full size\">\n        <img src=\"/ru/academy/course/img/5_step_algorithm_19.1.jpg\" alt=\"Slide 5 step algorithm 19.1\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; let p=this.src.endsWith('.jpg')?this.src.replace('.jpg','.png'):this.src.replace('.png','.jpg'); this.src=p; this.parentNode.href=p;\">\n        <span class=\"slide-zoom-hint\">🔍 Enlarge slide</span>\n      </a>\n      <figcaption class=\"slide-card-footer\">\n        <span class=\"slide-hint-text\">Click on the image for interactive full-screen viewing</span>\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n    <h3><strong>2. Basic Scheme for Designing a Prevention Program</strong></h3><div class=\"table-container-responsive\"><table class=\"academy-table factors-table\">\n  <thead><tr>\n      <th><span class=\"table-accent-text\"><strong>1. Problem Modeling ⇒</strong></span></th>\n      <th><span class=\"table-accent-text\"><strong>2. Model Verification ⇒</strong></span></th>\n      <th><span class=\"table-accent-text\"><strong>3. Goal and Task Modeling ⇒</strong></span></th>\n      <th><span class=\"table-accent-text\"><strong>4. Activity Plan Development ⇒</strong></span></th>\n      <th><span class=\"table-accent-text\"><strong>5. Result Evaluation</strong></span></th>\n    </tr></thead><tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <p style=\"text-align: center;\">Consequences (Deviance) <span class=\"table-accent-text\"><strong>⇒</strong></span>\n        <p style=\"text-align: center;\">\\ | /\n        <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>PROBLEM <span class=\"table-accent-text\">⇒</span></strong>\n        <p style=\"text-align: center;\">/ | \\\n        <p style=\"text-align: center;\">Factors (Stress) <span class=\"table-accent-text\"><strong>⇒</strong></span>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Research Methods:</strong><ul>\n          <li>literature review,</li>\n          <li>statistics,</li>\n          <li>surveys and testing,</li>\n          <li>expert assessments,</li>\n          <li>results of interviews and focus groups.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"table-accent-text\"><strong>⇒ </strong></span>Expected Outcomes\n        <p style=\"text-align: center;\">\\ | /\n        <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span class=\"table-accent-text\">⇒ </span>GOALS <span class=\"table-accent-text\"> </span></strong>\n        <p style=\"text-align: center;\">/ | \\\n        <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"table-accent-text\"><strong>⇒ </strong></span>Tasks\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        Target Groups X Prevention Tiers\n        =<ul>\n          <li>Organizational Plan</li>\n          <li>Calendar Plan</li>\n          <li>Resource Plan</li>\n        </ul>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        Evaluation Indicators\n        Effectiveness Criteria\n        Evaluation Methods\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <ul>\n          <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Description of the target group (object)</li>\n          <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Description of the problem (contradiction)</li>\n          <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Description of risk and protective factors (biopsychosocial model)</li>\n          <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Description of consequences</li>\n        </ul>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: left;\">Hypothesis testing – assessing the strength of problem factors and their consequences</td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: left;\">\n        <ul>\n          <li>Goal formulation</li>\n          <li>Selection of target factors and setting tasks</li>\n          <li>Definition of evaluation procedure</li>\n        </ul>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: left;\">\n        <ul>\n          <li>Alignment of tasks and activities</li>\n          <li>Provision of resources for plans</li>\n        </ul>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <ul>\n          <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Research design</li>\n          <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Evaluation implementation</li>\n          <li style=\"text-align: left;\">Evidenced effectiveness</li>\n        </ul>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table></div>\n    <figure class=\"lecture-slide-card\">\n      <div class=\"slide-card-header\">\n        <span class=\"slide-badge\">🖼️ Slide from table to matrix 19.2</span>\n        <span class=\"slide-caption-title\">Slide from table to matrix 19.2</span>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"/ru/academy/course/img/from_table_to_matrix_19.2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"slide-zoom-btn\" title=\"Click to open slide in full size\">\n        <img src=\"/ru/academy/course/img/from_table_to_matrix_19.2.jpg\" alt=\"Slide from table to matrix 19.2\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; let p=this.src.endsWith('.jpg')?this.src.replace('.jpg','.png'):this.src.replace('.png','.jpg'); this.src=p; this.parentNode.href=p;\">\n        <span class=\"slide-zoom-hint\">🔍 Enlarge slide</span>\n      </a>\n      <figcaption class=\"slide-card-footer\">\n        <span class=\"slide-hint-text\">Click on the image for interactive full-screen viewing</span>\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n    <h3><strong>3. How this scheme transforms into the Prevention.AI 4D-matrix</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>X-Axis (Stages):</strong> These are the 5 columns of our table (from problem to evaluation).</li>\n  <li><strong>Y-Axis (Risk Level):</strong> Derives from Steps 1 and 4 (Universal, selective, indicative prevention).</li>\n  <li><strong>M-Axis (Modality):</strong> Derives from Step 1 (Analysis of risk factors according to the biopsychosocial model).</li>\n  <li><strong>Org-Axis (Scale):</strong> Derives from Step 4 (Target groups: individual, family, school).</li>\n</ul>"
